From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:20:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] DsRunner: switch the in-game reset off with
 /_pico/igr.off

A game that misbehaves with the in-game reset hook, or a player who
does not want the hotkey, needs a way to leave the patch out without
another loader build.

When /_pico/igr.off exists, the arm7 sets a new flag in the flags word
of IPC_COMMAND_ARM9_SET_ROM_FILE_INFO and the arm9 patcher skips the
in-game reset patch. The OS_ResetSystem patch is not affected. The file
is checked before the rom is opened, so the directory sector of the rom
is still in the fat window when its location is taken from it. DsRunner
creates or deletes the file according to its setting "inGameReset".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018ba2i77rK9QaTUSsETPJXV
---
